    evidence: "Verified official June/July 2026 REST and WebSocket docs and privacy-safe Home Assistant 2026.7.4 live shapes: REST arrays or changed_states/service_response; WebSocket context/response with separate target and service_data; 45 response-capable live actions classified without identifiers."
